{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"Approach A: Terminal Story Arc\n\n      \n      \n\n        \n          1. Hero — Live Terminal Animation\n          Typewriter effect: user types /llm → AI diagnosis unfolds in real-time\n          Tagline: \"One agent. All databases. Zero complexity.\"\n        \n\n        \n          2. Three Modes — Interactive Tabs\n          Click tabs: Slash / SQL / Natural Language → terminal output switches\n        \n\n        \n          3. Six Features — Scroll-triggered Cards\n          /health → /dbtop → /sentinel → /scheduler → /rule → /llm\n          Each card: left=description, right=real terminal mockup with animation\n        \n\n        \n          4. Architecture Diagram\n          Three-layer visualization: Perception → Assessment → Diagnosis\n        \n\n        \n          5. Install + CTA\n          One-liner install + GitHub Stars + Apache 2.0\n        \n\n      \n\n      ~5 sections, feature-by-feature deep dive\n    \n    \n      A. Terminal Story Arc\n      Core idea: Hero 区一个震撼的终端动画，然后逐个展示六大功能，每个都有真实输出\n\n      \n        Strengths\n        \n          DBA 看到真实输出立刻产生共鸣\n          终端动画是独特的视觉锤\n          叙事清晰：从\"它是什么\"到\"它能做什么\"\n        \n      \n      \n        Risks\n        \n          六个功能逐一展示，页面较长\n          CTO 可能没耐心看完所有技术细节","choice":"a","id":null,"timestamp":1774963302536}
{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"Approach A: Terminal Story Arc\n\n      \n      \n\n        \n          1. Hero — Live Terminal Animation\n          Typewriter effect: user types /llm → AI diagnosis unfolds in real-time\n          Tagline: \"One agent. All databases. Zero complexity.\"\n        \n\n        \n          2. Three Modes — Interactive Tabs\n          Click tabs: Slash / SQL / Natural Language → terminal output switches\n        \n\n        \n          3. Six Features — Scroll-triggered Cards\n          /health → /dbtop → /sentinel → /scheduler → /rule → /llm\n          Each card: left=description, right=real terminal mockup with animation\n        \n\n        \n          4. Architecture Diagram\n          Three-layer visualization: Perception → Assessment → Diagnosis\n        \n\n        \n          5. Install + CTA\n          One-liner install + GitHub Stars + Apache 2.0\n        \n\n      \n\n      ~5 sections, feature-by-feature deep dive\n    \n    \n      A. Terminal Story Arc\n      Core idea: Hero 区一个震撼的终端动画，然后逐个展示六大功能，每个都有真实输出\n\n      \n        Strengths\n        \n          DBA 看到真实输出立刻产生共鸣\n          终端动画是独特的视觉锤\n          叙事清晰：从\"它是什么\"到\"它能做什么\"\n        \n      \n      \n        Risks\n        \n          六个功能逐一展示，页面较长\n          CTO 可能没耐心看完所有技术细节","choice":"a","id":null,"timestamp":1774963303247}
{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"Approach B: Problem → Solution Narrative\n\n      \n\n        \n          1. Hero — Problem Statement + Terminal\n          \"Database is slow. Your pager fires.\" → OpenDB terminal appears, diagnoses in real-time\n          Emotional hook: every DBA's 3am nightmare\n        \n\n        \n          2. Before/After — Split Screen\n          Left: Traditional workflow (5 tools, 30 min) → Right: OpenDB (1 command, 2 min)\n        \n\n        \n          3. Core Capabilities — 3 Pillar Cards\n          Monitor (/dbtop + /sentinel) | Diagnose (/rule + /llm) | Act (/health + skills)\n          Each pillar: one key metric + one terminal screenshot\n        \n\n        \n          4. Why OpenDB — Value Props Grid\n          Multi-DB | Zero Deps | 273 Rules Offline | AI + Rules Hybrid | 60+ Skills\n        \n\n        \n          5. Install + GitHub + CTA\n          One-liner + Star button + \"Join the community\"\n        \n\n      \n\n      ~5 sections, problem-driven narrative\n    \n    \n      B. Problem → Solution Narrative\n      Core idea: 从 DBA 的痛点切入，展示 OpenDB 如何用一条命令解决传统需要 30 分钟的问题\n\n      \n        Strengths\n        \n          情感共鸣强：DBA 都经历过半夜被叫起来排障\n          Before/After 对比直观震撼\n          CTO 能快速抓住核心价值（降本增效）\n        \n      \n      \n        Risks\n        \n          功能展示不够深入（三个 pillar 压缩了细节）\n          Before/After 对比需要精心设计才不显得老套","choice":"b","id":null,"timestamp":1774963308025}
